        <p class="text-xs text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          High-throughput distributed key-value storage engine in Go. Utilizes Raft consensus protocol for fault tolerance and LSM-tree disk compaction.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-medium text-purple-200 bg-purple-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-purple-400/30">Go</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-medium text-purple-200 bg-purple-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-purple-400/30">golang</span>
